y: ICICI Lombard 1st first party cover\n\nThis inspection was done by owner before submitting the car for insurance claim. This type of video ensures a proof that there are no further damage or scratches after leaving the car for insurance claim at the dealership. \n\nBelow the right side rear door there's a scratch along with dent which was caused due to mis-judgement. A road divider was hit causing the dent and insurance could be claimed by just giving the Rs 1000 processing fee if one has 1st first party insurance cover. ICICI Lombard provides unlimited claims for Honda cars when their 1st party insurance is purchased through any Honda Dealership.\n\nHonda Amaze Insurance Claim: Full Inspection Before Service at Pinnacle Honda | ICICI Lombard 1st Party\n\nIf you’re about to send your car for an insurance claim, watch this first! In this video, I provide a detailed car inspection of my Honda Amaze S-MT 2021 before submitting it to Pinnacle Honda in Kolkata for an insurance claim.\n\nThis type of video serves as a crucial proof of the car's condition, ensuring that there are no additional damages or scratches after leaving the vehicle at the dealership. My car suffered a dent and a scratch on the right-side rear door due to a misjudgment while driving.\n\nMy ICICI Lombard 1st party insurance covers this type of damage, requiring only a processing fee of ₹1,000. For Honda cars, ICICI Lombard offers unlimited claims if the insurance is purchased through a Honda dealership.\n\nJoin me as I document the damage and explain the insurance claim process, making sure you are prepared for your own claim.\n\nIn this video, you will find:\n\nA full walkthrough and close-up of the damage to the car.\n\nHow to document your car's condition before an insurance claim.\n\nDetails on the ICICI Lombard claim process for Honda cars.\n\nThe role of the dealership in the insurance claim.\n\nDealership Information:\n\nPinnacle Honda: No 739, Chandrani Towers Anandapur, near Ruby Hospital, Kolkata, West Bengal 700107\n\nWebsite: dealer.hondacarindia.com\n\ncar insurance claim process\n\ninsurance claim on car\n\nfirst party car insurance claim\n\ncar scratch and dent repair\n\ncar damage inspection\n\ninsurance claim settlement\n\nHonda Amaze insurance claim\n\nICICI Lombard car insurance claim\n\ncar inspection before insurance claim\n\nPinnacle Honda service\n\ncar damage proof before service\n\nmisjudgement car accident\n\nhow to claim insurance for car dent\n\ninsurance claim for minor damage\n\ncar service station fraud\n\ndocumenting car damage\n\n#HondaAmaze #CarInsurance #InsuranceClaim #ICICILombard #PinnacleHonda #CarMaintenance #CarRepair #AutoCare #Kolkata #DIY #CarVlog #Automotive #InsuranceClaimProcess #Honda #CarDamage", "channel_id": "UCWGb_mEs7cvrh9EQ7rjCQFg", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCWGb_mEs7cvrh9EQ7rjCQFg", "duration": 90, "view_count": 91, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kCDi3Gl1CJ0", "categories": ["People & Blogs"], "tags": [], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {}, "subtitles": {}, "comment_count": 0, "location": "PINNACLE HONDA", "channel": "Prayas Bhattacharyya", "channel_follower_count": 1120, "uploader": "Prayas Bhattacharyya", "uploader_id": "@prayasbhattacharyya", "uploader_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@prayasbhattacharyya", "upload_date": "20240925", "timestamp": 1727296204, "availability": "public", "webpage_url_basename": "watch", "webpage_url_domain": "youtube.com", "extractor": "youtube", "extractor_key": "Youtube", "playlist_count": 300, "playlist": "ICICI Lombard after:2024-06-01 before:2024-12-01", "playlist_id": "ICICI Lombard after:2024-06-01 before:2024-12-01", "playlist_title": "ICICI Lombard after:2024-06-01 before:2024-12-01", "playlist_webpage_url": "ytsearch300:ICICI 